  https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.15898v1
- EvolvingWorld（open-schema state lifetime 与 promotion boundary；Status: Experimental；文学角色模拟，不证明物理因果 dynamics）:
  https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.17250v1

